OL,3,GNEWSA'My trading card shop is more of a
OL,4,Acommunity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new trading card game (TCG) shop in
OL,7,FShrewsbury has become a community hub
OL,8,Ffor enthusiasts, with customers
OL,9,Ftravelling from across the West
OL,10,FMidlands to join in.
OL,12,FOwner Aydin Uyan said the shop's
OL,13,Fsuccess had come through word of mouth
OL,14,Fafter he spent several years on the
OL,15,Fscene selling cards at shows around the
OL,16,FUK.
OL,18,FUyan's shop Triple A Collectibles
OL,19,Fspecialises in selling individual cards
OL,20,Fcovering franchises including Pokemon,
OL,21,FOne Piece, Union Arena, Dragon Ball Z,
OL,22,FMagic: The Gathering and Star Wars.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
